Add greeting function with custom formatting

Implements greet(name, greetingWord) function with:
- Default greeting: "Hello, <name>!"
- Custom greeting word support (e.g., "Hi, <name>!")
- Graceful handling of empty/missing names (fallback to "there")
- Whitespace trimming for cleaner output

Includes comprehensive test coverage and npm test script.

